{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo introduces you to the world of <strong>Delive-R\u2019 Us</strong>. You\u2019ll learn the core mechanics of accepting delivery orders, shopping for items, and rushing them to your customers on time. After the tutorial, you\u2019ll complete a full in-game work day to put your skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided tutorial that walks you through the game\u2019s basic mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One playable supermarket and delivery route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single in-game work day to experience the full delivery loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A preview of your apartment and the lifestyle upgrade system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the Full Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast city with multiple supermarkets, delivery zones, and varied customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded apartment upgrade system with more ways to improve your lifestyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full progression system with challenges to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional delivery days and expanded gameplay variety</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985650?t=1756902168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985650/330b60e11d31a3e1e315de72a2b461a8baed6214/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756902168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985650/da361f07a1761dd98dd0436260d77bfd06ed9a48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756902168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985650/da361f07a1761dd98dd0436260d77bfd06ed9a48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756902168","categori